epub-shrink (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: shrink EPUB images for CrossInk/XTEInk e-ink readers.
  * Default to overwriting the input file in place; --suffix writes
    NAMESUFFIX.epub beside the original instead.

